# Day 17 - AI Vehicle Cost & Fuel Analysis Dashboard

## Challenge
Build an AI-powered Vehicle Cost & Fuel Analysis Dashboard using Claude and CSV data.

## Objective
Learn how AI can act as a Data Analyst by processing CSV datasets, calculating business metrics, generating insights, and creating complete HTML dashboards.

## What I Learned

### 1. CSV Data Analysis
- Uploading and analyzing structured CSV datasets.
- Extracting meaningful information from raw data.
- Performing automated calculations using AI.

### 2. Dashboard Creation
- Generating complete HTML dashboards using Claude.
- Creating KPI cards and interactive layouts.
- Designing responsive dashboards.

### 3. Business Metrics
- Cost per kilometer analysis.
- CO₂ emission comparison.
- Maintenance cost calculations.
- Monthly operating cost estimation.

### 4. Data Visualization
- Bar Charts
- Doughnut Charts
- Line Charts
- Gauge Charts

### 5. Fuel Comparison
Compared:
- Petrol
- Diesel
- CNG
- EV
- E85

Based on:
- Running Cost
- Maintenance Cost
- Environmental Impact
- Refueling Time
- Overall Score

## Key Insights

- EV has the lowest running cost.
- CNG provides strong cost efficiency.
- E85 reduces emissions but may not always reduce total running cost.
- Petrol offers convenience due to widespread availability.
- Different fuels serve different use cases.

